 seen  this happen if you're paying close  attention to the calendar date of each  event you may have also known that there  has to be more than one chucky andy  figures it out before we as the audience  know i explained this in full detail in  my andy barkley horror history speaking  of andy he's on his way to the asylum to  try to save nika and the others and he  receives a strange call from  someone tiffany  jennifer  even i lose track she leaves a one-word  clue from chucky and andy is supposed to  know the meaning of it the word is  disembowel andy's plan is to hide his  gun inside the short-haired chucky to  get it into harrogate and then  disembowel him to get it back once  inside however chucky and tiffany don't  know that so what's the deal here this  part has always confused me the best  sense that i can make of it is that  chucky was threatening andy basically  just implying that he plans to  disembowel him and it's just an ironic  coincidence that andy turns the tables  on him if anyone has a better  explanation let me know also when he  does break open the chucky doll we can  see all the brains and guts and stuff  even though this chucky doll has only  been alive for like under an hour it  seems like the amount of time it takes  for chucky to turn human can be really  inconsistent for reference in child's  play too it takes about 48 hours for  chucky to turn human after being  reincarnated but in curse he doesn't  turn human for the entire movie but  let's get back on topic dr foley he's  about to give some kind of treatment to  claire when he says this  how's jake  the next chucky installment would be the  chucky tv series where a character named  jake wheeler loses both of his parents  my first thought is that carlos somehow  knows jake wheeler and dr foley is  asking how jake is holding up after the  death of his father however after  spending all day trying to piece  together the timeline using the new  information from season one i think  maybe it's possible that he was asking  about jake's mother who would have died  two years before colt in 2015. if you're  confused at all about the chucky  timeline watch this video where i  explain all of it of course another  possibility is that dr foley is asking  about a different person named jake and  i agree that is the easy explanation but  it doesn't account for this part where  chucky knocks out dr foley and tries to  get nika to finish him off with the  bottle i'm not a killer this is part of  a different voodoo ritual where chucky's  aim is to corrupt an innocent to get  them to kill in other words jake wheeler  wasn't the first one he tried to corrupt  it was actually nika at the very least  this proves that don mancini kind of  knew what was going to happen in season  one at the time that he made calls so  it's not out of the question that dr  foley actually was asking carlos about  our jake also the actor that plays dr  foley is michael theriault he also plays  lexi's dad nathan cross in the tv series  it's definitely a different character so  maybe the character he plays in the  series is a relative of dr foley which  would further connect to these two  communities but that's just speculation  however since chucky is unable to get  nika to kill for him he does the next  best thing and takes over her body and  this obviously leads into the events of  season 1 but first we got to talk about  that post-credits scene for the first  time since child's play 2 we see andy's  former foster sister kyle and when she  appears she's wearing the same hat and  outfit that we saw her hand when she  first appeared in that movie chucky and  tiffany do leave the hospital but  he'll be back he always comes back  and so will i in the next chucky episode  of things you missed where i'll be  covering season 1 of the chucky tv  series remember to subscribe to cz's  world for new horrors every week ring  the death bell and select all  notifications and i will see you in the  next one assuming we both survived  [Music]  you
 

